  "approach": "Teach adjective agreement as two matches (gender and number), with the four forms of an -o adjective, adjectives that only change for number, quantity words like mucho, and the masculine plural for mixed groups.",
  "coverage": [
    "An adjective matches its noun in gender and number",
    "-o adjectives have four forms: alto, alta, altos, altas",
    "Adjectives ending in -e only change for number: una casa grande, unas casas grandes",
    "mucho / mucha / muchos / muchas agrees too: muchos libros, muchas gracias",
    "A mixed group takes the masculine plural: Ana y Luis son simpáticos",
    "Descriptive adjectives usually come after the noun: una casa grande"
  ],
